{%- comment -%}
  GIRLYF — BRAND STORY

  The full-bleed moment. `scripts/build-homepage.mjs` has listed this as "needs
  the 20–30s video"; the video is still Girlyf's to shoot, so the section takes
  an image or a video and is complete either way rather than waiting.

  THE WORDS SIT ON A PAPER PANEL, NOT ON THE PHOTOGRAPH
  Paper type over a scrim is the obvious layout and it cannot be made safe here.
  The shoot is ivory satin in bright natural light; getting Paper to 4.5:1 over
  that highlight needs roughly 80% Espresso over the image, which throws the
  photograph away to save the sentence. A Paper panel is Espresso on Paper —
  15.23:1, and true of every photograph Girlyf will ever upload, including the
  ones nobody has taken yet. The overlay setting survives, but it now sets the
  image's mood rather than carrying the legibility.

  THE HEADING IS A TEXTAREA, AND ITS LINE BREAKS ARE HONOURED
  Each line rises out of its own mask. Splitting a sentence into visual lines in
  JavaScript is guesswork that changes with the viewport and re-flows mid
  animation; letting whoever writes the line decide where it breaks is both more
  reliable and — for a display serif at 56px — the decision a designer wants to
  be making anyway.

  The media drifts against the scroll. `data-girlyf-parallax` goes on the media,
  never on the frame: both write `transform`, and the loser fails silently.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% liquid
  assign video = section.settings.video
  assign image = section.settings.image
  assign lines = section.settings.heading | strip | newline_to_br | split: '<br />'
  assign overlay = section.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0
%}

<div
  class="girlyf-story girlyf-story--{{ section.settings.text_position }}"
  style="
    --girlyf-story-height: {{ section.settings.height }}svh;
    --girlyf-story-overlay: {{ overlay }};
  "
>
  <div class="girlyf-story__frame" data-girlyf-reveal="media">
    {%- comment -%}
      The drift lives on this wrapper, not on the <img> or <video> inside it.
      An <img> from `image_tag` cannot carry a hyphenated data attribute through
      Liquid's named arguments, and a wrapper keeps image and video on one code
      path instead of two that have to be kept in step.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <span class="girlyf-story__media" data-girlyf-parallax="60">
      {%- if video != blank and video.sources.size > 0 -%}
        <video
          data-girlyf-autoplay
          {% if video.preview_image != blank %}
            poster="{{ video.preview_image | image_url: width: 1600 }}"
          {% endif %}
          muted
          loop
          playsinline
          preload="none"
          tabindex="-1"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          {%- for source in video.sources -%}
            {%- if source.format == 'mp4' -%}
              <source src="{{ source.url }}" type="{{ source.mime_type }}">
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </video>
      {%- elsif image != blank -%}
        {{
          image
          | image_url: width: 3000
          | image_tag:
            widths: '600, 900, 1200, 1600, 2000, 2600, 3000',
            sizes: '100vw',
            loading: 'lazy',
            alt: image.alt
        }}
      {%- else -%}
        {{ 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </span>

    {%- comment -%}
      Espresso, not black. The scrim is the one place a large area of the brand's
      darkest role is allowed, and it exists to make Paper-coloured type legible
      over photography nobody has seen yet.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <span class="girlyf-story__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="girlyf-story__panel" data-girlyf-reveal>
    {% if section.settings.eyebrow != blank %}
      <p class="girlyf-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    {% if lines.size > 0 %}
      <h2 class="girlyf-heading girlyf-story__heading girlyf-lines" data-girlyf-reveal="lines">
        {%- for line in lines -%}
          {%- assign copy = line | strip_html | strip -%}
          {%- if copy != blank -%}
            <span class="girlyf-lines__mask">
              <span class="girlyf-lines__line" style="--girlyf-line-index: {{ forloop.index0 }};">
                {{- copy -}}
              </span>
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </h2>
    {% endif %}

    <span class="girlyf-rule girlyf-story__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>

    {% if section.settings.body != blank %}
      <p class="girlyf-body">{{ section.settings.body | escape }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    {% if section.settings.button_label != blank %}
      <a class="girlyf-story__button" href="{{ section.settings.button_link | default: '#' }}">
        {{ section.settings.button_label | escape }}
      </a>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .girlyf-story {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    align-items: end;
    min-block-size: var(--girlyf-story-height, 80svh);
    isolation: isolate;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--girlyf-cream);
  }

  .girlyf-story__frame,
  .girlyf-story__panel {
    grid-area: 1 / 1;
  }

  .girlyf-story__frame {
    position: relative;
    block-size: 100%;
    inline-size: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .girlyf-story__media {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: block;
  }

  .girlyf-story__media > * {
    inline-size: 100%;
    block-size: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .girlyf-story__scrim {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to top,
      rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / calc(var(--girlyf-story-overlay, 0.35) * 1.6)),
      rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / var(--girlyf-story-overlay, 0.35)) 55%,
      rgb(var(--color-foreground-rgb) / calc(var(--girlyf-story-overlay, 0.35) * 0.5))
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* The panel. Espresso on Paper is 15.23:1 whatever the photograph behind it
     turns out to be — which is the whole reason the words are not on the image. */
  .girlyf-story__panel {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    align-self: end;
    justify-self: stretch;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--gap-lg);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    border: 1px solid rgb(var(--girlyf-cocoa-rgb) / 0.2);
    border-radius: var(--card-corner-radius, 4px);
    margin: var(--page-margin);
    padding: var(--gap-2xl);
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .girlyf-story__panel {
      justify-self: start;
      inline-size: min(34rem, 42vw);
      margin: max(var(--page-margin), 3vw);
      padding: 3rem;
    }

    .girlyf-story--centre .girlyf-story__panel {
      justify-self: center;
      align-self: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .girlyf-story--centre .girlyf-rule {
      transform-origin: center;
    }

    .girlyf-story--end .girlyf-story__panel {
      justify-self: end;
    }
  }

  .girlyf-story__heading {
    font-size: var(--font-size--h2);
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .girlyf-story__heading {
      font-size: var(--font-size--h1);
    }
  }

  .girlyf-story__rule {
    --girlyf-rule-width: 4.5rem;
  }

  /* The theme's primary button, by hand rather than by block, because this
     section takes no blocks. Espresso fill, Paper label — the same pair
     `settings.palette_primary_button_*` resolves to. */
  .girlyf-story__button {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-body--family);
    font-size: var(--font-size--h5);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-background);
    background-color: var(--color-foreground);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-foreground);
    border-radius: var(--button-border-radius-primary, 14px);
    padding: 0.9em 2.2em;
    transition:
      background-color var(--girlyf-hover-duration, 320ms) var(--girlyf-ease, ease),
      color var(--girlyf-hover-duration, 320ms) var(--girlyf-ease, ease);
  }

  .girlyf-story__button:hover,
  .girlyf-story__button:focus-visible {
    background-color: var(--girlyf-cocoa);
    border-color: var(--girlyf-cocoa);
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Girlyf brand story",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-wrapper",
  "disabled_on": { "groups": ["header", "footer"] },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Video wins when both are set. A clip here should be muted with no audio track and under 8MB, with a poster frame."
    },
    { "type": "video", "id": "video", "label": "Video" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Image" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Words" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Girlyf" },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "info": "Each line rises on its own. Break the lines where you want them.",
      "default": "Adorn your\nelegance always"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "body",
      "label": "Body",
      "default": "Ornaments don’t just decorate you. They celebrate you. Gold-plated, tarnish-free, and made for the days you want to feel like yourself only more so."
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "button_label", "label": "Button", "default": "Shop new in" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "button_link", "label": "Button link" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Layout" },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "text_position",
      "label": "Text position",
      "options": [
        { "value": "start", "label": "Left" },
        { "value": "centre", "label": "Centre" },
        { "value": "end", "label": "Right" }
      ],
      "default": "start"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "height",
      "label": "Height",
      "min": 50,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 85
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "overlay_opacity",
      "label": "Overlay",
      "info": "Sets the mood of the photograph. The words sit on their own panel, so this does not affect whether they can be read.",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 60,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 15
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Girlyf brand story", "category": "Girlyf" }]
}
{% endschema %}
